{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39968","headline":"赠表弟黄校书辂 · 徐夤","name":"赠表弟黄校书辂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"产破身穷爲学儒，我家诸表爱诗书。\n严陵虽说临溪隐，晏子还闻近市居。\n佳句丽偷红菡萏，吟窗冷落白蟾蜍。\n闲来共话无生理，今古悠悠事总虚。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐夤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39968.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39968","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}